{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cek7bCRJHrSbvFkk7JmWt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The implementation is complete and all acceptance criteria are met. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Implementation Complete ✅\n\n### Changes Made:\n\n1. **Added new error code** (`src/main/kotlin/.../api/ApiError.kt`):\n   - Added `SHIPMENT_CANCELLED` to the `ErrorCode` enum for consistent error handling\n\n2. **Implemented confirm endpoint** (`src/main/kotlin/.../shipment/ShipmentController.kt`):\n   - Added `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint\n   - Returns 404 if shipment doesn't exist\n   - Returns 409 (Conflict) if shipment is cancelled\n   - Transitions `CREATED` → `CONFIRMED`\n   - Idempotent: confirming an already `CONFIRMED` shipment succeeds without changes\n   - Persists updates through the repository\n\n3. **Added comprehensive tests** (`src/test/kotlin/.../shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt`):\n   - Confirms a created shipment transitions to CONFIRMED\n   - Confirming an already confirmed shipment is idempotent\n   - Confirming a cancelled shipment returns 409 Conflict\n   - Confirming a non-existent shipment returns 404 Not Found\n\n### Verification Results:\n\n✅ **All 17 tests pass** (5 original + 4 new confirm tests + 8 other tests)  \n✅ **No new Maven dependencies** added  \n✅ **Existing build passes**  \n✅ **Error responses** are consistent with the API envelope pattern  \n✅ **Only shipment feature modified** (plus ApiError.kt for the error code)  \n\nThe implementation follows the existing Spring Boot + Kotlin patterns and reuses the established error handling framework. The endpoint is fully idempotent and production-ready."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":636,"cache_read_input_tokens":43076,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_inpu